WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:02.811
♫ Here comes Korean Claus,
here comes Korean Claus

00:00:02.811 --> 00:00:05.121
♫ dropping kimchi under your tree. ♫

00:00:05.121 --> 00:00:10.121
("The Nutcracker" by Tchaikovsky)

00:00:13.831 --> 00:00:14.811
- Right, what are we talking about?

00:00:14.811 --> 00:00:15.961
Christmas.

00:00:15.961 --> 00:00:19.421
(rock music)

00:00:19.421 --> 00:00:20.731
- Santa Claus!

00:00:20.731 --> 00:00:21.551
- Father Christmas!

00:00:21.551 --> 00:00:22.651
- Old Man Santy Claus.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:24.351
- Do you think Santa eats his reindeer?

00:00:24.351 --> 00:00:25.321
He's fat.

00:00:25.321 --> 00:00:28.031
- Today, we are going
to try to become Santa.

00:00:28.031 --> 00:00:29.371
- That seems hard.

00:00:29.371 --> 00:00:32.151
- I have very unmagical
Christmas memories.

00:00:32.151 --> 00:00:32.751
- I'm Jewish.

00:00:32.751 --> 00:00:34.431
I feel like I've been training
for this my whole life.

00:00:34.431 --> 00:00:35.571
- We're meeting the real Santa.

00:00:35.571 --> 00:00:37.591
- And that's pretty (bleep) sick.

00:00:37.591 --> 00:00:41.941
(Christmas bell music)

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.101
- Ah, it's Santa.

00:00:44.101 --> 00:00:45.031
- Yep.

00:00:45.031 --> 00:00:46.811
- So Santa, you're a wizard.

00:00:46.811 --> 00:00:48.851
- Well, I have been
called a wizard, actually.

00:00:48.851 --> 00:00:50.031
- You're a wizard.

00:00:50.031 --> 00:00:51.711
Were you just born Santa Claus?

00:00:51.711 --> 00:00:55.051
- No, actually it hasn't
always been the same

00:00:55.051 --> 00:00:56.961
human embodiment of the spirit.

00:00:56.961 --> 00:00:58.351
(gasping)

00:00:58.351 --> 00:00:59.892
So, I'll tell you when I was your age,

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:01.372
I certainly had no idea I'd be sitting

00:01:01.372 --> 00:01:02.492
in this seat today.

00:01:02.492 --> 00:01:05.312
- So any of us could become Santa.

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:05.932
- That's right.

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:07.082
- Would I turn white?

00:01:07.082 --> 00:01:08.232
(laughing)

00:01:08.232 --> 00:01:10.542
- When you put on the
Santa suit, you are Santa.

00:01:10.542 --> 00:01:11.812
- As far as any kids are concerned,

00:01:11.812 --> 00:01:14.272
we are Santa mother (bleep) Claus.

00:01:14.272 --> 00:01:15.602
No other intro needed, we're just gonna

00:01:15.602 --> 00:01:17.262
take our clothes off and
dress like Santy Clauses.

00:01:17.262 --> 00:01:18.142
- Whoa!

00:01:18.142 --> 00:01:19.912
- Oh look at these goofy clown trousers.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:20.772
- That's pretty cute, right?

00:01:20.772 --> 00:01:22.172
Hey, what's up, I'm Santa.

00:01:22.172 --> 00:01:24.032
- I think I put these
pants on backwards, unless

00:01:24.032 --> 00:01:26.312
Santa just puts his hand
on his butt all the time.

00:01:26.312 --> 00:01:29.112
- I would be the most excellent
cuddle partner right now.

00:01:29.112 --> 00:01:30.492
- Cause you know when
you think of Christmas

00:01:30.492 --> 00:01:31.652
you think about (bleep).

00:01:31.652 --> 00:01:33.112
Your parents definitely
(bleep) during Hanukkah.

00:01:35.232 --> 00:01:36.052
You're a Leo.

00:01:36.052 --> 00:01:37.392
- If you saw someone wearing this

00:01:37.392 --> 00:01:38.932
at a truck stop restroom,

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.852
you would run in the other direction.

00:01:40.852 --> 00:01:42.432
- As kids, we grew up
seeing Santa's outfit

00:01:42.432 --> 00:01:43.292
and we just accept it,

00:01:43.292 --> 00:01:45.312
but like this is gaudy as (bleep), Santa.

00:01:45.312 --> 00:01:48.042
- This guy must be so fat.

00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:48.892
- Forget the bags,

00:01:48.892 --> 00:01:51.172
Santa could just stuff
all his presents in here.

00:01:51.172 --> 00:01:52.552
- I could fit Zach in here.

00:01:52.552 --> 00:01:55.052
I could fit Zach all cuddled
up like a kangaroo baby.

00:01:55.052 --> 00:01:57.132
- Do you feel the spirit of giving now?

00:01:57.132 --> 00:01:58.432
- I feel the spirit of something.

00:01:58.432 --> 00:02:00.212
- Merry Christmas, boys.

00:02:00.212 --> 00:02:01.392
- There's one main reason why I'll never

00:02:01.392 --> 00:02:03.052
look like Santa Claus.

00:02:03.052 --> 00:02:04.532
He's hot as (bleep).

00:02:04.532 --> 00:02:05.892
- Great, I get to have hair in my mouth

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:06.912
for the rest of the day.

00:02:06.912 --> 00:02:08.632
- It's like I got pubes in my mouth.

00:02:08.632 --> 00:02:09.572
(spitting)

00:02:09.572 --> 00:02:11.352
- Oh, it's like having a kitty on my face.

00:02:11.352 --> 00:02:12.272
(moaning)

00:02:12.272 --> 00:02:14.472
- Do I look just like a crazy person?

00:02:14.472 --> 00:02:15.952
- [Zach] Hello children!

00:02:15.952 --> 00:02:17.132
(groaning)

00:02:17.132 --> 00:02:18.672
- Here you go, Asian Santa,

00:02:18.672 --> 00:02:20.612
ready to give you more homework.

00:02:20.612 --> 00:02:22.272
- [Zach] And the final
touch to Santa's outfit

00:02:22.272 --> 00:02:24.012
Michael Jackson's gloves.

00:02:24.012 --> 00:02:24.992
- Oh, I get gloves?

00:02:24.992 --> 00:02:26.912
- Santa and Michael Jackson
have a lot in common.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:30.772
- The present cements the look.

00:02:30.772 --> 00:02:32.672
- I'm digging this Asian Santa vibe.

00:02:32.672 --> 00:02:33.712
- I know you've been a bad kid,

00:02:33.712 --> 00:02:34.632
I know you've been a bad kid!

00:02:34.632 --> 00:02:35.512
I watch you, I look at you,

00:02:35.512 --> 00:02:36.992
I watch you while you sleep.

00:02:36.992 --> 00:02:38.392
- Let's do this, let's
go eat a bunch of cookies

00:02:38.392 --> 00:02:41.512
and (bleep) tell people they're naughty.

00:02:41.512 --> 00:02:44.212
(rock music)

00:02:44.212 --> 00:02:45.392
- Okay, Santa training.

00:02:45.392 --> 00:02:46.352
Where do we start?

00:02:46.352 --> 00:02:48.032
- Number one is to adopt a...

00:02:48.032 --> 00:02:50.472
- [Group] Jolly attitude.

00:02:50.472 --> 00:02:54.482
(Santa-type laughing)

00:02:54.482 --> 00:02:55.572
- And number two is...

00:02:55.572 --> 00:02:59.872
Identify people on the nice list.

00:02:59.872 --> 00:03:01.052
Exactly.

00:03:01.852 --> 00:03:04.123
- Have you been a good boy this year?

00:03:04.123 --> 00:03:05.473
- Never.

00:03:05.473 --> 00:03:06.443
- It is a little weird

00:03:06.443 --> 00:03:08.563
having another person sit on your lap.

00:03:08.563 --> 00:03:09.283
Oh God!

00:03:09.283 --> 00:03:11.563
- What do you do when
they're just naughty?

00:03:11.563 --> 00:03:12.343
- [Voiceover] You punish him?

00:03:12.343 --> 00:03:14.203
You punish the bad boys?

00:03:14.203 --> 00:03:15.483
- Do you want to be punished?

00:03:15.483 --> 00:03:16.343
(laughing)

00:03:16.343 --> 00:03:17.873
- And number three is

00:03:17.873 --> 00:03:20.363
give as many gifts as you can

00:03:20.363 --> 00:03:22.883
as quickly as possible.

00:03:22.883 --> 00:03:23.723
- Yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:03:23.723 --> 00:03:26.453
You've been good, Merry Christmas.

00:03:26.453 --> 00:03:28.843
- Yes, a kitty's coming to you Chloe.

00:03:28.843 --> 00:03:30.693
Yes, yes you're welcome.

00:03:30.693 --> 00:03:32.123
- I'm going now.

00:03:32.123 --> 00:03:34.133
- Meow, meow, meow, she's gettin' a kitty.

00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:36.393
- It seems like it takes
a lot of physical fitness

00:03:36.393 --> 00:03:37.633
to be Santa.

00:03:39.603 --> 00:03:41.383
- Can we see those guns,
what are you rockin'?

00:03:41.383 --> 00:03:44.143
(cheering)

00:03:44.153 --> 00:03:46.793
♫ How many Santas do you wish? ♫

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:49.183
- Now, remember to eat the cookies

00:03:49.183 --> 00:03:50.903
and drink a little bit of the milk.

00:03:50.903 --> 00:03:53.083
- I already feel sick
from like three cookies.

00:03:53.083 --> 00:03:54.703
- What if you're lactose intolerant?

00:03:54.703 --> 00:03:55.783
- Fake it. Just fake it.

00:03:55.783 --> 00:03:57.773
Pour a little bit in the plant, you know.

00:03:58.403 --> 00:03:59.583
(laughing)

00:04:00.523 --> 00:04:02.003
- I feel bad about the plant mostly,

00:04:02.003 --> 00:04:03.273
that plant is gonna die.

00:04:03.273 --> 00:04:05.523
- You four inspire me.

00:04:05.523 --> 00:04:08.243
I mean, when you're
tryin' to do what I do,

00:04:08.243 --> 00:04:11.583
I just hope that I can help
in every way that I can.

00:04:11.583 --> 00:04:13.703
- And to all a good night!

00:04:13.703 --> 00:04:15.843
(cheering)

00:04:15.843 --> 00:04:17.143
- I wanted to say thank you

00:04:17.143 --> 00:04:19.363
to the children all over the world.

00:04:19.363 --> 00:04:20.743
You are amazing.

00:04:20.743 --> 00:04:22.383
I love you.

00:04:22.383 --> 00:04:25.103
And remember to stay on that nice list,

00:04:25.103 --> 00:04:28.713
be considerate, and be a Santa's helper.

00:04:28.713 --> 00:04:30.223
Make something for somebody

00:04:30.223 --> 00:04:31.643
and you'll be like me,

00:04:31.643 --> 00:04:33.833
you'll be a Santa's helper.

00:04:33.843 --> 00:04:34.703
Yay!

00:04:34.703 --> 00:04:37.733
(laughing and clapping)

00:04:40.737 --> 00:04:43.640
- Oh my god, Jesus Christ, Zach.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.126
- Have you ever run into trouble

00:04:45.126 --> 00:04:45.938
sneaking into someone's house?

00:04:45.938 --> 00:04:46.890
- No, never have.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.645
- We're Santa Clause, we're doing it guys.

00:04:48.645 --> 00:04:53.645
(intense music)

00:04:55.329 --> 00:04:57.569
- [Eugene] Frosty,
what's up with that guy?

00:04:57.569 --> 00:04:58.964
